    {
      "id": "s01-flow",
      "intent": "The recurrence returns to the DQ-CTM thought stage itself, while the dense carrier continues through the flow.",
      "claim": "ThinkSR end to end: encoder, windows, shared DQ-CTM ticks, decoder.",
      "narration": "The image first becomes a dense carrier, because super-resolution needs spatial detail. Windowing partitions that carrier before the thought process reads and updates it. The recurrent ticks stay inside DQ-CTM, and the same parameters are reused at each tick.",
